{"sourceUrl":"https://lfc.njau.edu.cn/info/1085/3013.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:54:06.241633+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://lfc.njau.edu.cn/info/1085/3013.htm","html":"<div><div>\n<p><span><span>根据教育部相关文件要求，为规范我院招收优秀应届本科毕业生免试攻读研究生（以下简称推免生）工作，结合我院实际情况，现将有关事项通知如下：</span></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><span><span>一、接收推免生基本条件</span></span></p>\n<p><span>1. <span>品德</span><span></span><span>良好，遵纪守法，诚实守信，学风端正。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>2. <span>勤奋</span><span></span><span>学习，刻苦钻研，学术兴趣浓厚</span></span><span><span>，</span></span><span><span>有较强的创新意识和创新能力。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>3. <span>取得本科就读学校推荐免试资格。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>4. <span>身体健康状况符合国家和我校规定的体检要求。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>5. <span>未有任何尚在期限内的处分。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>二、招生类别及专业</span></span></p>\n<p><span>1. <span>推荐免试硕士生：我院全日制硕士招生专业均可接收推免生。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>2. <span>推荐</span><span></span><span>免试直博生：我院全日制学术型博士招生专业均可接收直博生。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>3. <span>为了</span><span></span><span>进一步优化研究生招生生源结构，维护考生利益和公平竞争环境，我院招收推免生规模不超过</span><span>202</span></span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>年全日制硕士研究生招生计划的</span>50%<span>。招收推免生人数以最终推免生系统确认的录取人数为准。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>三、接收推免生程序</span></span></p>\n<p><span>1. <span>即日</span><span></span><span>起至</span></span><span><span>2026</span><span>年</span><span>9</span><span>月</span><span>20</span><span>日中午</span><span>12:00</span></span><span><span>（期间</span>24<span>小时开放），凡符合上述申请条件且有意愿报考我校的优秀应届本科毕业生，请登录</span></span><strong><span><span>“</span><span>南京农业大学接收推荐免试研究生网上申请系统</span><span>”</span></span></strong><span><span>，务必如实填写各项信息并提交。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>2. <span>申请者须在报名时上传以下材料扫描件，请将所有材料扫描</span></span><strong><span><span>按编号顺序合并为</span>1<span>个</span><span>PDF</span><span>文件后上传</span></span></strong><span><span>（注意：无需寄送纸质材料）：</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span>1<span>）本人有效身份证件正、反面；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span>2<span>）《教育部学籍在线验证报告》（</span><span>PDF</span><span>版，请前往学信网认证）；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span>3<span>）大学本科阶段成绩单（须加盖学校教务处公章）；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span>4<span>）《政治思想情况表》；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span>5<span>）《推荐免试生申请表》或《直博生申请表》</span></span><span><span>；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span><span>6</span><span>）</span></span><span><span>《诚信承诺书》（附件</span> 4<span>）</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>四、面试工作安排</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span>1. <span>面试方式、时间、地点</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>方式：采用线下现场面试</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>报到</span></span><span><span>时间：</span>202</span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>年</span>9<span>月</span></span><span><span>16</span></span><span><span>日</span></span><span><span>9</span><span>：</span><span>00-12</span><span>：</span><span>00</span><span>，现场查验并收取以上纸质材料</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>报到</span></span><span><span>地点：</span></span><span><span>生</span></span><span><span>科楼</span>C</span><span><span>2011</span><span>（具体分组安排另行通知，请及时关注手机短信，或直接联系</span><span>025-84395869</span><span>陈老师）</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>面试时间：第一批</span></span><span>202</span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>年</span>9<span>月</span></span><span><span>16</span></span><span><span>日</span></span><span><span>14</span></span><span>:</span><span><span>0</span></span><span>0</span><span><span>，</span></span><span><span>后续批次陆续通知</span></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><strong><span>2. <span>面试内容</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>复试内容包括英语、专业知识、综合素质考察等，形式均为口试，主要考核学生的外语水平、学科知识结构和综合素质能力。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>对</span><span>“</span><span>直博生</span><span>”</span><span>应加强科研能力方面的考核，可以采取多种形式考核，如实验操作、报告、写作等，以考察其是否具有攻读博士学位研究生的能力和潜质。</span></span></p>\n<ol>\n<li><p><strong><span><span>面试成绩</span></span></strong></p><p><span><span>（</span>1<span>）复试成绩为考核小组成员打分的平均分（满分</span><span>100</span><span>分，合格分为</span><span>60</span><span>分）；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span>2<span>）排名方法：按平均分由高到低排名。</span></span></p><p><span><span>五、拟录取</span></span></p><p><span><span>考核小组根据复试成绩排名由高到低确定拟录取名单，含确认是否直博以及拟录取导师等信息。复试成绩不合格的考生不予录取，思想品德考核不合格的考生不予录取。</span></span></p><p><span><span>六、其他</span></span></p><p><span><span>未尽事宜请看南京农业大学</span>202</span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>年招收推荐免试研究生章程：南京农业大学研究生招生网</span></span><span><span>https://zsgz.njau.edu.cn/info/1005/1742.htm</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p><p> </p><p><span><span>生命科学</span></span><span><span>学院</span>  </span></p></li>\n</ol>\n<p><span>202</span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>年</span>9<span>月</span><span>1</span></span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span>日</span></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n</div></div>","textSha256":"82e034138cf9d2152504266feb4607d4e1eabb61664a5e154e2c3a5d2b4ba326","textLength":1177,"sourceSha256":"2c80aed234528172f96640a4e67752d7e0d5189ea832e919240fc1264419ff7b","selector":"#vsb_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-4db8e6c3359fcd27bad1","title":"2026年南京农业大学生命科学学院2027年招收推荐免试研究生工作通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:54:06.241633+00:00"}
